WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.520
Union Fest is over now,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.010
but I would like to create more events

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.660
with you all that are 
as fun as this one was!

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.800
Union Fest's final stage.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.550
The passion that connected 
the three countries

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.920
never waned...

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.660
That night, the party continued
 with great enthusiasm

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.520
until the end.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.020
Starting tomorrow,
 we'll return to our usual,

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.590
calm and peaceful days.

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:46.060
And then...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:30.790
Yes?

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.970
Hero, you're going out with the 
Princess and the others, right?

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:39.220
Yes, they're making 
our lunches right now.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.380
Yeah, I took a peek earlier.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.680
This is for you.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.650
Are these clothes?

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.940
I had them made at a shop I frequent.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.530
Try it on. I'm sure it'll suit you.

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:58.150
Wow, this is nice!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.070
It's not bad to wear something other 
than your Hero outfit, right?

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.030
Yeah! But is it really 
okay for me to have these?

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:06.580
I don't want to take them back. 
Please wear them.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:11.530
Now, Hero, this will be your 
last mission this summer.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.370
Okay!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.210
Relax and enjoy your day today

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.570
with the Princess and your friends.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:20.200
Have fun with the Princess, 
Rebecca, and the others.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.010
Can you do it?

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:24.010
I will do my best, 
I swear on my Hero title!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.970
Right, then go!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.640
Hey, Sink!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.650
Your Highness, Nanami!

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.400
Sink, where'd you get those clothes?

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.010
Ecle gave them to me.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:38.730
Oh really?

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.690
Looks good.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.070
Everybody's here.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.580
Sorry for the wait.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.470
Then, shall we?

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:53.080
The highland picnic tour for 
the rulers and the Heroes!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.280
Off we go!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.950
This is amazing!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.590
It's nice, isn't it?

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.980
This is our favorite summer spot.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:11.100
The water is really nice 
and there are even fish.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:13.690
You're right, there are so many!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.940
And so many local gods...

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:19.260
The protection of the sprites 
is especially strong here.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:21.400
That's why nature's bounty 
is so plentiful here,

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.400
but you shouldn't be so 
impressed quite yet.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.910
We have much more to show you.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.770
Let's take a picture!

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.420
A picture with everybody!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.650
Shall we take turns?

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.680
First, Nanami and you guys...

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.670
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.280
Leo-sama, it's okay, right?

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.230
Yes. Noir!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.180
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.430
Secret Escort Troop.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.680
At your service!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:57.010
Okay, Noir, can you 
take the picture then?

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:58.440
Sure.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:03.940
All right, there's still plenty 
of places I want to show you!

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.860
Adel-sama, Isuka-dono?

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:46.360
The Hero Crystals I gave 
to Sink and Gaul...

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.620
we never gave you one, Nanami.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.160
Oh, yeah...

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.550
You also have the proper 
qualifications to be a Hero.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.060
We'll make sure to have created one

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.710
for you by next time.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.910
Really?! Thank you!

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:03.300
Well, kid, we had quite 
some experiences,

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.100
but it was you and our little 
shrimp that woke me,

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.800
so I'll say thanks.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.900
I'd like to express 
my gratitude as well.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.500
You've inherited the Demon Crystal!

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.520
Make sure to keep training 
on the other side, as well!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.520
Yes, I'll do my best!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:21.100
Sorry that I didn't find

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.940
a better time to secretly 
hand this over...

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.640
Oh, no.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:28.720
Really, thank you for 
making the trip out here.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.950
So anyway, here's what 
you asked for.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.210
Everyone!

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:50.220
Our rulers and Heroes 
are about to return!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.210
The surprise Hero farewell party

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.510
organized by us young knights...

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.350
...will have to be really huge!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:02.050
This has indeed become quite huge.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:04.750
Yes, Prince Gaul's 
holding the reins.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:08.810
The princesses and Heroes are arriving!

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.610
Everybody, get ready!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.840
I bet you didn't expect that, did you?!

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.700
You were probably thinking 
of having a light meal,

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.670
but we won't allow that!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.500
A surprise party organized by us

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.980
young knights to thank our rulers

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.510
and Heroes for their hard work.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:38.270
I bet you never suspected that 
we had planned this all along!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.740
We didn't!

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.600
You got us!

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:45.250
Now rulers and Heroes, please...

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.940
...take each others' hands 
and get up on stage!

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:03.710
Hey, Hina. I'm back.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.170
Welcome back.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.420
I got this from the princesses.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.520
Shall we?

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.860
Sounds good. I'll have some.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.220
So how was the farewell party?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.930
The young ones all seemed to have fun.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:26.440
They liked the swords
I made, too.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.190
What did you make them?

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:30.700
Small blades for use at home.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.360
An all-around knife

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.680
great for cutting fruit or for camping.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:39.870
Since Rebecca likes cooking, 
I made her a cooking knife.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.850
You made household blades, eh?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.780
That brings back memories.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.210
You're telling me.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:51.340
But I got to make nice blades 
and see nice smiles.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:55.220
That alone made it worth coming back.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:56.550
I see.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.180
Welcome back, everybody.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.720
Captain Riselle!

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:07.660
We're back!

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.030
Princess, sorry for the wait.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.340
Don't worry.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.100
Oh, where's Cou-sama?

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:17.010
We both left after getting 
ready, but she said

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.910
she remembered some urgent business.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.410
Oh.

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.540
Sink, you're late!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.960
Wha... Cou-sama?!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.820
I wanted to give 
those two "girl talk" fans

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.590
as much time alone as possible.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.000
So why don't we two inheritors of

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.600
the Hero King take a bath together?

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.190
That reminds me, Rebecca-san.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.240
Do you think you'll get 
anywhere with that thing?

00:09:55.240 --> 00:10:00.070
Oh, you mean that Sink 
always calls me Becky?

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.550
Yes.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:03.220
Not at all.

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.080
I think I'll always be Becky to him.

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:09.370
To him, I'll always be the girl

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:12.530
that was his little childhood friend.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.650
I don't think that's necessarily true.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.400
Well, it's okay.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.430
Nothing's changed anyway.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:24.060
Anyway, I think your work 
will be really hard,

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.430
so if you ever need 
my help, let me know.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:31.420
I'm Pastillage's Hero, but 
I am also your best friend.

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:34.250
Yes, thank you.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.190
The same goes for you, 
any time you need me!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.820
Yes, thank you, Princess.

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:44.930
Sink, you're so good.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:47.260
Really? Thank you.

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:48.440
All right. Rinsing it out now.

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:49.080
Okay.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:01.200
Oh yeah, I wanted to 
ask you something.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.550
Yes, what is it?

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.410
Do you have any plans to get together

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:08.350
with Rebecca or Millihi-nee, 
or maybe both?

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.260
What?!

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.970
You know, if a ruler 
and Hero get married,

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.360
it has some influence on the 
country ruling business, so...

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:19.360
Uhh.. let's wash your tail first!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.240
Please do!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:25.760
Well, I'm still just a fledgling 
Hero, and I haven't

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.490
reached my goal yet.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.190
Goal?

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.000
Winning against Nanami.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.060
We've had quite a few fights,

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.250
but I've never beat her in a serious match

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.260
or public event.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.000
<i>Victory!</i>

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.270
Oh yeah, you did lose in the 
one-on-one during the Fest.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.260
Yes...

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.930
It's my goal to win 
against Nanami during

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.710
a public event on earth.

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:53.460
Until that's done,
 I'll always be just a kid.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.270
That's why I think it's too 
early for things like that.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.550
I see.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:02.640
Don't forget that you 
have to take care of those

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.570
who stay by your side while 
you march towards your goal.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.850
You're right.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.840
Thank you, Cou-sama.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.950
I'll make sure to remember that.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.320
Okay.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.100
Rebecca!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.130
Cou-sama!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.020
Was your bath okay?

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:23.010
Sink washed me, so I'm all good.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.720
Ah, a freshly washed Cou-sama.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.110
You smell good.

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:28.510
Indeed.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.770
You two, please feel free 
to move onto the bed.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.020
Okay!

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.080
Sink, you, too.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.040
Okay!

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.730
Wait, I don't think that's okay.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.650
Let's sleep together!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.340
Come on, Sink.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:45.240
If you say so...

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.550
Sink, come here!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.300
Those two are already asleep.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.380
They got up early today.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.570
I'll turn off the lights.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.070
So, Sink...

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:09.990
Yes?

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.050
Do you remember how I said

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:16.980
that I loved you when 
we parted last time?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.610
Of course. I said the same thing.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.940
It's kind of like a dream

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:26.360
that I'm holding the hand 
I let go of back then.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.780
Though we do have to part again soon.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.050
The next time I can come

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.870
will be after my exams in fall.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.800
It'll be really soon.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.380
Yes, I'll be waiting.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:44.790
Tonight I want to hug you tightly

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:49.110
so I won't forget your 
smell and warmth.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.420
Is that okay?

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:53.000
Of course, as much as you want.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.630
Then hug!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.660
So warm... and happy...

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:16.840
Now, Leo-sama, 
Nanami-san, it's morning!

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:21.000
Gau-sama and Genoise, 
get up, get up, get up!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.130
Come on, get up, please!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.240
Violet-san, you're sticking 
to the routine too much...

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.310
Can't you think of a more gentle way

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.980
to wake us on the day we have to part?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.980
This has nothing to do with that.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:45.860
After completing many tasks,

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.490
the Heroes will return to 
their homeland for now.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.100
Biscotti's Hero, Sink,

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:54.360
and Pastillage's Hero, Rebecca,

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.330
shall have some time to recover.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:15:00.510
Now, please return the divine 
swords to your summoners.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:10.360
The return ritual is now finished.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.100
Thank you!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.650
Rebecca, I want you to have this.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:31.240
It's my treasure; my mother 
gave it to me before she left.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.030
So the other day, you 
went to go get this?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.780
That's right.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.400
I want you to have it...

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.370
and, if possible, wear it often.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.810
But this is too precious...

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.920
The summoner and the Hero.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:50.800
An article of promise to 
connect the two worlds.

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:54.660
For that, an item that both 
have deep ties to is best.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.100
That's one of the requirements

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.060
of Rico's new summoning technique.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:02.060
I'm sure that this will definitely 
create a path for us.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.520
Then I'll keep it safe for you.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.050
I'll make sure that I can return it

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:09.440
any time you want to wear it.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.720
Thank you.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:16.070
I love you, Cou-sama!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.120
I love you, too, Rebecca!

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:22.460
Sink, I have this for you.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:25.880
It's a Biscotti-made Earth clock.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.130
Rico designed it,

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:33.380
and Eclair, Yukikaze, and 
I helped with the assembly.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:39.140
Thank you. I will treasure this.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:39.970
Okay!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.730
This is from me.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:50.990
The Galette army's MVP 
prize for the Union Fest.

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.150
Awesome! Thank you!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.800
I'll probably be back here in no time!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.490
So please wait for me, Leo-sama!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:03.990
Yes, I'm counting on you, Hero Nanami.

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.750
All right, Princess, Cou-sama.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.610
Bye you two!

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:12.510
See you soon!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.750
Yes!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:35.530
Earth / Great Britain, City of London

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:40.660
Oh?

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.980
Welcome back, Nanami.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.110
Mom...

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:47.970
When did you get back?

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:50.920
I would have come to pick 
you up, if you had called.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.490
I'm home...

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.650
What?  Are you still jet-lagged?

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:58.930
Make sure to put out 
your laundry and trash.

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.370
Okay.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.930
Same Day - Earth / Japan Kinokawa City, Tokino

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:11.190
Is this your room?

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:18.930
Yes?!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.360
Hey, Sink.

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:22.700
Nanami? You got home safely?

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.230
Yeah, how about you?

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:26.410
We're fine, too.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.390
Want to talk to Becky?

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:28.210
Yeah!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.940
Yes. I'm fine, too.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.280
Where did you go back to?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:39.570
So our summer of 
adventures came to a close.

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.920
Our memories stayed with us,

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:48.150
and we have solid proof we were there, too.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.770
It's nice to be home,

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:57.240
but since I slept with 
Cou-sama every night,

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.240
I can't settle down...

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:02.170
<i>That's something every 
Hero has to deal with.</i>

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.440
Hang in there!

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:06.370
I really understand how you felt 
at the beginning of spring now.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.330
See!

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.790
<i>Oh, did you write your letter?</i>

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.330
Yes, I did.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:14.220
We're doing our homework at 
the library tomorrow, right?

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.260
Will you look over it to make sure I

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.090
didn't mess up the Flonyard letters?

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.140
Roger that.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.140
Sink, come eat.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.640
Okay!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.880
See you tomorrow.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.110
Mom, this way!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:39.620
Sink, sorry for the wait.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.280
Hey...

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.570
Is something wrong?

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.040
No, it's just that I haven't

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.370
seen you outside with your hair down often.

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:57.380
I kind of did it so that it would 
work with Cou-sama's pendant.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.080
I look a bit older, don't I?

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.930
I was surprised because you 
look quite a bit older.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.220
Becky, you're really pretty!

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.030
Thanks.

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:10.350
That reminds me,

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.740
you saved me during the 
pendant episode, too.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:16.860
We both did it. The two Heroes.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:21.360
Since you're a Hero and 
totally look grown up,

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.480
I think calling you by your childhood 
name "Becky" might be rude.

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:30.160
I guess then it's "Rebecca"?

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:35.810
Well, I did think that I might like it

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.670
if you called me that...

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:45.400
Rebecca.

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:49.040
It's way more embarrassing
 than I imagined

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.910
to have you 
actually call me that!

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:52.440
Why does it feel so weird?!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:55.710
Rebecca, it's just because 
you're not used to it.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:56.650
Rebecca?

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.290
Stop. Stop, I can't!

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:01.230
Really?

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:05.460
I'm sorry. I'll be fine 
with Becky for now.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.000
I'll change my hair back, too.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.990
Well if you say so, Becky.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.670
Sink, you're so nice, even though 
I'm being totally crazy.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.210
No, no.

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.900
Thank you, Sink. I love you!

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.760
Yes! I love you, too!

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.220
Let's go!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:25.140
Yeah!

00:21:27.190 --> 00:21:29.770
The second summer vacation 
of middle school...

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:32.470
It was the second time for 
Sink, and the first time

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.500
for Nanami and myself to 
live the Hero experience.

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:37.430
The place where fun and hot days

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:40.160
and people we love are waiting for us...

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:44.560
We'll definitely be 
going back there again.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:32.950
This summer was truly great, again.

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.480
Yes, and we'll be back 
together in no time, right?

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.250
Yes, so everybody...

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:45.000
<b>See you soon!</b>

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:40.050
See you soon!
